  "body": "# Backrooms: Found Footage\n\n<table align=\"right\">\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\">\n      <strong>My Other Modpacks</strong>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/projectdreamshift\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dtMQBIA6/57e375f1702b6b37c17de23c9d814375f4dc43a8.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" alt=\"Project Dreamshift\"></a>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/adventurepluss\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/fApyk3le/3cc2bb64273aab66414119050e8e3f938d63d8dc.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"72\" alt=\"SMP\"></a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p>\n  <sup>The Best Backrooms Experience for Minecraft</sup>\n  <br><br><br><br><br>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n## How To Play\nTo enter the Backroom world, once you create a world, you have to find a way to get buried, such as dropping blocks, sand, or gravel on yourself. Then you will be sent to the Backrooms\n* * * * *\n### Basic Controls\n- Shift - Run\n- Ctrl - Sneak\n- F - Flashlight\n- C - Zoom\n- B - Set Up Voice Chat\n- Middle Mouse - Ping\n* * * * *\n<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.modrinth.com%2Fdata%2Fcached_images%2F98f90bf1991bba03fe26b74e4185f5eec745ec5d_0.webp&amp;cx=0&amp;cy=49&amp;cw=869&amp;ch=189&amp;precrop&amp;w=1600&amp;output=png\" alt=\"BisectHosting sponsor banner\" width=\"100%\" usemap=\"#backrooms-sponsor\">\n<map name=\"backrooms-sponsor\">\n  <area coords=\"0,0,10000,10000\" href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/backrooms\" title=\"BisectHosting\">\n</map>\n\n* * * * *\n## Description\nThis modpack is a more stable version of the \"<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/minecraft-found-footage\">Minecraft Backrooms Found Footage</a>\" mod with some gameplay improvements.\n\n⚠️ **Minecraft Backrooms Found Footage Mod does not support performance mods like Sodium, Optifine or Vulkan, which can cause performance issues on low-end PCs.**\n\n\n**_A video by the creator of <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/minecraft-found-footage\">The Backrooms Mod</a>_**\n\n⬇️\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/XnO1GAlR3qo\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n",
